:: Himari - The Prize [bg-sanctuary]
<h1 class="ptitle">NEGAN'S OFFICE</h1>
<<run setup.himari.mark('prize')>>
<<addmins 30>>
<br />
The guard at the door made you wait, then waved you in and stepped outside. He faced the corridor wall when he closed the door behind you. It took you a second to understand why.
<br /><br />
She was standing by the window. Someone had washed her and put her in a clean white dress, the first clean thing you had seen anyone wear on this ship. Her feet were bare on the steel floor. Her braid had been redone, tight and neat, and her hands were folded in front of her the way somebody had shown her to fold them.
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image 'people/himari/prize.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
Negan sat on the edge of his desk with a glass in his hand, looking at her the way other men look at a sunset.
<br /><br />
<<negan>>
	Meet Dolly. Don't bother asking her name, she can't tell you, and I wouldn't remember it if she could. I named her myself. Suits her, doesn't it?
<</negan>>
<br />
He put the glass down and walked over to her. She did not move. She looked at the floor.
<br /><br />
<<negan>>
	Special order. Somebody a long way from here is paying more for this little doll than this whole ship is worth in fuel. And he's paying for her exactly the way she came out of that box. Untouched. You understand what I'm saying?
<</negan>>
<br />
He stepped behind her and put his hands on her waist, and looked at you over her head, and let you look.
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image 'people/himari/prize_reveal.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
She stood very straight in the thin white dress, the way people stand when they have been told not to move. Her face was blank. His was not. He was enjoying this, and he wanted you to see him enjoying it.
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image 'people/himari/prize_close.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
Without any hurry he hooked his thumb under one strap and pushed it off her shoulder, and then he took a handful of the white dress and drew it down.
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<video 'himari/prize_undress'>>
</center>
<br />
He pulled it down below her breasts and left it there. She did not cover herself. She stood with her arms at her sides and her eyes on the floor, and the only thing that moved was her breathing.
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image 'people/himari/prize_bare.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
Negan cupped one of her breasts in his hand and weighed it, like fruit at a market, and smiled at you over her shoulder.
<br /><br />
<<negan>>
	Take a good look, because after today nobody looks. Nobody touches. My men don't. My doctor barely does. And you sure as hell don't. Anybody breaks that rule, I break him.
<</negan>>
<br />
He let go and pulled the dress back up over her shoulders, careful and slow, like a man wrapping a present.
<br /><br />
<div id="hm2_eyes">
	<<set _hmEyesLabel = "Keep your eyes on Negan">>
	<<linkreplace _hmEyesLabel>>
		<<run $('#hm2_look, #hm2_buyer').hide()>>
		<<run setup.himari.addTrust(3)>>
		You did not look at her. You looked at Negan the whole time, and you kept your face still.
		<br /><br />
		He noticed. Of course he noticed.
		<br /><br />
		<<negan>>
			Huh. A gentleman. I'll be damned.
		<</negan>>
		<br />
		She noticed too. When he turned away to pour another drink, her eyes came up from the floor and found you for a moment, and went back down.
		<br /><br />
		<<link 'Leave'>>
			<<goto 'Sanctuary'>>
		<</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="hm2_look">
	<<set _hmLookLabel = "Look at her">>
	<<linkreplace _hmLookLabel>>
		<<run $('#hm2_eyes, #hm2_buyer').hide()>>
		<<run setup.himari.addTrust(-2)>>
		You looked. Everybody looks, Negan had said, and he was right. She saw you do it.
		<br /><br />
		<<negan>>
			Atta boy. There's no shame in it. Look all you want today. It's free today.
		<</negan>>
		<br />
		He laughed and went back to his glass.
		<br /><br />
		<<link 'Leave'>>
			<<goto 'Sanctuary'>>
		<</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="hm2_buyer">
	<<set _hmBuyerLabel = "Ask who the buyer is">>
	<<linkreplace _hmBuyerLabel>>
		<<run $('#hm2_eyes, #hm2_look').hide()>>
		<<you>>
			Who's the buyer?
		<</you>>
		<br />
		Negan's smile stayed exactly where it was. Only his eyes changed.
		<br /><br />
		<<negan>>
			Somebody you don't want to meet. That's all you need to know, and it's more than my own men know. Don't ask me again.
		<</negan>>
		<br />
		Behind him, the young woman in the white dress had not moved at all.
		<br /><br />
		<<link 'Leave'>>
			<<goto 'Sanctuary'>>
		<</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
